What must never be added
------------------------

Do not import data from proprietary databases — RadioReference, commercial
frequency directories, or any subscription service — even partially, even
"just to fill a gap". Their compilations are licensed, not public domain, and a
single import would make this database undistributable. Every curated entry
must cite a public source in its `source` column.

